6. NO WARRANTY

   The Software works at a very low level. It sends commands to the USB-C port controller of your
   computer, puts other computers into firmware-update mode, and ERASES AND REINSTALLS THEM when
   you ask it to. Operations of this kind can fail, can leave a computer unable to start until it
   is restored, and can destroy data permanently.

